OL,3,GNEWSAGiffnock park evacuated and closed
OL,4,Aafter gas main bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park on the outskirts of Glasgow has
OL,7,Fbeen evacuated and closed due to a gas
OL,8,Fleak.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said it was called to a
OL,11,Freport of a burst gas main in Eastwood
OL,12,FPark in Giffnock at about 16:00.
OL,14,FEast Renfrewshire Council said all
OL,15,Fbuildings within the park were closed,
OL,16,Fso any activities at the leisure centre
OL,17,For pitch have been cancelled.
OL,19,FScottish Gas Networks (SGN) is dealing
OL,20,Fwith the issue and people are advised
OL,21,Fto avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
